/target
/gen/schemas
# The ffmpeg staging directory is filled per build and never committed. The
# path has to exist before the crate compiles, because tauri-build checks
# every `resources` entry — so build.rs creates it, rather than a committed
# .gitkeep holding it open. Nothing in here is tracked, which is what keeps
# the installers from shipping a stray file out of it.
/resources/bin/
